# Marketing site — canonical source

**Canonical production URL:** [https://coop-ai.dev](https://coop-ai.dev); the configured production branch is `main`. Local source/design and actual deployed identity are distinct: verify the deployment before claiming an edit is live.

When editing the homepage, hero, or marketing demos, use the **current** stack — not legacy dark-theme VS Code mock carousels.

## Current homepage source

Dark environment with source page order: hero → the gap → logos → quotes → close. Inner pages stay light. Confirm the current entrypoint when editing; do not infer production artifact identity from this description.

| Piece | File |
|-------|------|
| Page theme | `website/src/components/HomePageTheme.tsx` (`body.home-page`) |
| Hero layout | `website/src/components/Hero.tsx` → galaxy bg + `<HeroDemoArtifact tone="dark" />` |
| Hero space | `website/src/components/HeroGalaxyBackground.tsx` |
| The gap | `website/src/components/HomeStackContextSection.tsx` |
| Quotes | `website/src/components/Testimonial.tsx` |
| Demo artefacts | `website/src/components/HeroDemoArtifact.tsx` |
| Home close | `website/src/components/HomeCloseSection.tsx` (no zsh terminal) |
| Site copy | `website/src/lib/site.config.ts` (`tagline`, `heroKicker`) |
| Light inner pages | `website/src/components/SiteAtmosphere.tsx` + `layout.tsx` (paper, grid, wash) |

Ask / Change / Indexed live on `/product`, not the homepage.

Demo flow labels: `// question` → `// pulling context from` → `// context found` → `// response` / `// edit` / `// complete`. Scenario dots on the artifact must stay clickable.

